\* All TLC check configs for AntflyOpenApiCodegen.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyOpenApiCodegen.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCheckStalePackage = FALSE
    BuggyCheckStaleRoot = FALSE
    BuggyPublicClientImportsInternal = FALSE
    BuggyCommitFailedPartial = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    GeneratedPackageShapeValid
    CommittedPackageShapeValid
    NoCommittedPartialPackages
    GeneratedCheckOnlyPassesForCurrentState
    Safety

==== BadInternalLeak
\* Expected-failure config: public client imports an internal-only package.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCheckStalePackage = FALSE
    BuggyCheckStaleRoot = FALSE
    BuggyPublicClientImportsInternal = TRUE
    BuggyCommitFailedPartial = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CommittedPackageShapeValid
    Safety

==== BadPartialCommit
\* Expected-failure config: a failed partial generation is committed.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCheckStalePackage = FALSE
    BuggyCheckStaleRoot = FALSE
    BuggyPublicClientImportsInternal = FALSE
    BuggyCommitFailedPartial = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoCommittedPartialPackages
    Safety

==== BadStalePackage
\* Expected-failure config: generated-check passes while a package is stale.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCheckStalePackage = TRUE
    BuggyCheckStaleRoot = FALSE
    BuggyPublicClientImportsInternal = FALSE
    BuggyCommitFailedPartial = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    GeneratedCheckOnlyPassesForCurrentState
    Safety

==== BadStaleRoot
\* Expected-failure config: generated-check passes while root openapi.yaml is stale.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCheckStalePackage = FALSE
    BuggyCheckStaleRoot = TRUE
    BuggyPublicClientImportsInternal = FALSE
    BuggyCommitFailedPartial = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    GeneratedCheckOnlyPassesForCurrentState
    Safety
